+## ACL Probe Contract
+
+Every counted A2A agent has one broker principal:
+
+`a2a_<agent_uid>`
+
+The offline topology verifier renders an ACL probe spec for every counted
+principal. Live credentials are not printed or committed; the probe spec names
+only subject shapes, durable bindings, and positive/negative checks.
+
+Positive probes:
+
+- publish own presence subject;
+- pull own `A2A_INBOX/a2a_<agent_uid>_inbox` durable;
+- ACK own delivery;
+- publish own receipt subject.
+
+Negative probes:
+
+- cannot pull another agent's inbox durable;
+- cannot subscribe to broad fleet subjects such as `dharma.a2a.>`;
+- cannot mutate streams or consumers via `$JS.API.STREAM.>` or
+  `$JS.API.CONSUMER.>`;
