+`scripts/runtime/a2a_standing_wake_loop.py` is the target-owned
+`StandingWakeLoop`, `WakeLease`, and `WakeCircuitBreaker` producer. It writes
+`dharma.a2a.standing_wake_loop_heartbeat.v1` worker heartbeats only when the
